WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
共数京张：把数据治理变成可进入的城市房间
The Data Co-op Line: making data governance an enterable urban room

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.000
一条无数据正线串起三座合作式治理站：众智园、AI 原点社区、大钟寺。不注册、不提交数据也能进入。
One no-data main line links three cooperative governance stations — Zhongzhiyuan, AI Origin Community, Dazhongsi. Entry never requires registration or data submission.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:28.000
六闸门依次复核：集体议定、临时用途权、可见数据劳动、派生链回执、公共回报、无数据等价。未通过闸门的场景不得开放。
Six reviewable gates in sequence: collective charter, temporary-use licence, visible data work, derivative-chain receipt, public return, no-data equivalence. A scenario may not open until its gate passes.

4
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
十二张场景卡，其中三张为产业测试舱；全部场景提供人工复核与无数据等价路径。
Twelve scenario cards, three of them industry test cells; every scenario keeps human review and a no-data equivalent path.

5
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:44.000
可复核，才可信。概念方案，非官方渲染；不代表政府背书或实施承诺。
Auditable, therefore trustworthy. Concept proposal — not an official rendering, endorsement or implementation commitment.
